 "remarks": "Experience the best of downtown living in this sun-filled top-floor 2-bedroom, 1-bath residence offering 875 square feet of thoughtfully designed space. The home has been freshly updated with a brand-new renovated kitchen, and beautiful hardwood floors run throughout. Enjoy a private balcony with sweeping downtown and city views, adding the perfect outdoor extension to your living space. Both bedrooms offer generous proportions, and the home is ready for you to move right in and make it your own. This full-service building features gatehouse security, an in-ground pool, a fitness room, on-site laundry, basement storage, and one assigned parking space. Common charges include heat, hot water, cooking gas, water, and sewer for added convenience, and the building's special assessment is finished. Ideally located in the heart of downtown, just moments from restaurants, shopping, and nightlife, with easy access to I-95 and the Metro-North station for an easy NYC commute.",
